OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying largely dry across the
OL,6,Fregion today with fine spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine. There is a small chance of
OL,8,Fthe odd shower in the afternoon, but
OL,9,Fstaying dry and pleasantly warm for
OL,10,Fmany.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSkies remaining clear at
OL,13,Ffirst tonight, and turning chilly. A
OL,14,Ffew mist and fog patches possible.
OL,15,FCloud increasing a little towards the
OL,16,Fend of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
