OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA dry but largely cloudy start
OL,6,Fon Sunday. Heavy and persistent rain
OL,7,Fwill arrive later with strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds. Mild but feeling cooler in the
OL,9,Frain.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,12,Fpleasant spells of warm sunshine on
OL,13,FMonday with light winds. Strengthening
OL,14,Fwinds on Tuesday and unseasonably
OL,15,Fwarm, some rain later. Fresher and
OL,16,Fbreezy on Wednesday with sunshine and
OL,17,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
